@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 6.4 New Product Email - class diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor<<View>> #EADCFF
  BackgroundColor<<Controller>> #D8F3DC
  BackgroundColor<<Service>> #DCECFF
  BackgroundColor<<Repository>> #FFF1C9
  BackgroundColor<<Entity>> #E0F3E7
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #FFE0E0
  BackgroundColor<<DTO>> #ECECEC
  BackgroundColor<<Scheduler>> #FFE8CC
}
hide empty members
hide circle

class View <<View>>

class ManagerProductController <<Controller>> {
  create(shopId, user, product, images, videos): 201 Result
  update(shopId, id, user, product, images, videos): Result
  unhide(shopId, id, user): 204
}
class ManagerProductService <<Service>> {
  save(shopId, id, actor, input, images, videos): Result
  unhide(shopId, id, actor)
}
class ProductQuotaService <<Service>> {
  requireAllowed(product)
}
class ShopProductNotificationService <<Service>> {
  published(product)
}
class ShopProductMailJob <<Scheduler>> {
  sendPending()
}
class ShopProductMailDelivery <<Service>> {
  deliver(id)
}
interface ShopProductPublicationRepository <<Repository>> {
  existsById(productId): boolean
  save(publication): ShopProductPublication
}
interface FavoriteShopRepository <<Repository>> {
  findByIdShopId(shopId): List<FavoriteShop>
  existsById(id): boolean
}
interface ShopProductMailRepository <<Repository>> {
  save(mail): ShopProductMail
  due(now, page): List<String>
  findLocked(id): Optional<ShopProductMail>
}
class ProductRepository <<Repository>> {
  findById(id): Optional<Product>
}
class UserRepository <<Repository>> {
  findById(id): Optional<User>
}
class "JavaMailSender (SMTP server)" as SMTP <<External>> {
  send(message)
}
class ShopProductPublication <<Entity>> {
  productId
  publishedAt
}
class ShopProductMail <<Entity>> {
  id
  productId
  shopId
  userId
  status: PENDING | SENT | FAILED | CANCELLED
  attempts
  nextAttemptAt
  createdAt
  sentAt
}
class FavoriteShop <<Entity>> {
  id: (userId, shopId)
}
class Product <<Entity>> {
  id
  name
  price
  status: ProductStatus
  adminHidden
}
class Shop <<Entity>> {
  id
  name
  status: ShopStatus
}
class User <<Entity>> {
  id
  email
  fullName
  role: UserRole
  status: UserStatus
  isEmailVerified
}

View --> ManagerProductController : POST /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/products\nPUT /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/products/{id}\nPUT /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/products/{id}/unhide
ManagerProductController --> ManagerProductService
ManagerProductService --> ProductQuotaService : unhide only
ManagerProductService --> ShopProductNotificationService : published(product)
ShopProductNotificationService --> ShopProductPublicationRepository
ShopProductNotificationService --> FavoriteShopRepository : followers of the shop
ShopProductNotificationService --> ShopProductMailRepository : queue one mail per follower
ShopProductMailJob --> ShopProductMailRepository : due(now, 20)
ShopProductMailJob --> ShopProductMailDelivery : deliver(id) per due id
ShopProductMailDelivery --> ShopProductMailRepository : findLocked(id)
ShopProductMailDelivery --> ProductRepository
ShopProductMailDelivery --> UserRepository
ShopProductMailDelivery --> FavoriteShopRepository : existsById(user, shop)
ShopProductMailDelivery --> SMTP : send
ShopProductPublicationRepository ..> ShopProductPublication
ShopProductMailRepository ..> ShopProductMail
FavoriteShopRepository ..> FavoriteShop
ProductRepository ..> Product
UserRepository ..> User
ShopProductMail ..> Product : productId
ShopProductMail ..> User : userId
Product "*" --> "1" Shop
FavoriteShop "*" --> "1" User
FavoriteShop "*" --> "1" Shop

note bottom of ShopProductNotificationService
  Publication is recorded once per product (Shop_Product_Publications), so
  unhide after an earlier publication queues no mail again.
  Only followers at that moment: role CUSTOMER, ACTIVE, verified email.
  One mail row per (product, follower), unique constraint uk_shop_product_mail.
  The rows are written in the same transaction as the product.
end note

note bottom of ShopProductMailJob
  Fixed delay 30 s (first run after 30 s). Takes up to 20 PENDING rows with
  nextAttemptAt <= now, oldest first. Off when app.shop-follow-mail.enabled=false.
  Each id goes to its own deliver() call: a RuntimeException is logged and skipped.
end note

note bottom of ShopProductMailDelivery
  Before sending: product ACTIVE and not admin-hidden, shop ACTIVE, user CUSTOMER and ACTIVE
  with verified email, still following. Otherwise the mail becomes CANCELLED.
  attempts + 1 before sending. MailException: attempts >= 5 gives FAILED,
  else nextAttemptAt = now + 2^attempts minutes (2, 4, 8, 16).
end note

@enduml
